From 696cd2e6a6632c40efc1d723ec6ccc2595252825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 03:33:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UI/UX audit fixes (U01 to U39)

Mobile: assistant switch in a top bar, Inbox as a direct tab, More sheet, Back goes to the inbox.
Data: newest 300 messages in a chat with Load earlier, one preview row per chat (migration 0014), query errors surface.
States: error and not-found pages, per-segment loading, one banner at a time.
Accessibility: control border and alert tokens, 12px minimum text, 44px targets, dialog semantics, page titles.
Consistency: PageShell, PageHeader, EmptyState, StatCard, LeadStatusBadge, ConfirmDialog, RadioCard, Checkbox.
